# Keep tools/ JavaScript checked out with LF on every platform.
#
# vitest's transform cannot parse a CRLF .mjs: it fails with
# "SyntaxError: Invalid or unexpected token" and reports the SUITE as failing with
# "no tests", which reads like a broken test rather than a line-ending problem.
# With core.autocrlf=true (the Windows default) git converts on checkout, so the
# tools/changelog.test.mjs suite silently stopped running twice before this was pinned.
*.mjs text eol=lf
